There are a number of factors that could cause actual results and developments to differ materially from those expressed or implied by these forward-looking statements, including levels of industry product supply, demand and pricing, in particular in light of significant price volatility for oil and natural gas; geopolitical, social and/or political instability, including worsening trade relations and tariffs; unfavourable macroeconomic conditions and inflationary pressures;

